# Tests (Pest)

- Every change gets a Pest test in tests/Feature (or tests/Unit for pure logic). Follow sibling tests in the same folder.
- Test behavior a user or admin sees: status codes, rendered text keys, database state, policies (forbidden cases too).
- Use factories and the fake drivers (SMS, payments, Telegram, geocoder). Never call real external services.
- Translations: TranslationsTest checks that ka/en/ru keys match; add keys to all three lang files.
- Run `composer check` before you say the task is done. Fix failures; do not skip or delete tests.
